@page "/Teste"

<PageTitle>testes</PageTitle>

<MudItem xs="12" md="5" Class="d-flex flex-column align-center justify-center">
    <MudPaper MaxWidth="420px">
    <MudImage Src="img-dt/crossover.png"
              Alt="Exercícios para Peitoral"
              Elevation="15"
              Class="rounded-lg mt-4 mt-md-0"
              Style="width: 100%; max-width: 420px; object-fit: cover;" />

   
        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mt-2 text-center" Style="color:coral">
            <ul style="color:var(--mud-palette-text-primary); padding-left: 20px;">
                <li class="mb-1"><b>CrossOver:</b> Exercício versatíl onde dependendo da variação consegue recrutar partes diferentes do peitoral, tanto maior ou menor.</li>
            </ul>
        </MudText>
    </MudPaper>
</MudItem>
<p class='mud-typography mud-typography-body1 mb-4'>Treine membros superiores (peito, costas, ombros e braços) em um dia e membros inferiores (quadríceps, isquiotibiais, glúteos e panturrilha) no outro. Permite alta frequência e boa recuperação por grupamento.</p>
<div class='mud-table mud-simple-table mud-table-bordered mud-table-striped mud-elevation-1'>
    <div class='mud-table-container'>
        <table class='mud-table-root'>
            <thead class='mud-table-head' style='background-color: var(--mud-palette-background-grey);'>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'>
                    <th class='mud-table-cell mud-typography-subtitle2'><b>Dia</b></th>
                    <th class='mud-table-cell mud-typography-subtitle2'><b>Treino</b></th>
                    <th class='mud-table-cell mud-typography-subtitle2'><b>Foco</b></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class='mud-table-body'>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Seg</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-filled mud-chip-size-small mud-chip-color-primary'>Upper</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Peito, Costas, Ombros, Braços</td></tr>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Ter</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-filled mud-chip-size-small mud-chip-color-secondary'>Lower</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Quadríceps, Isquiotibiais, Panturrilhas</td></tr>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Qua</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-outlined mud-chip-size-small'>Descanso</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Recuperação Ativa / Cardio</td></tr>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Qui</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-filled mud-chip-size-small mud-chip-color-primary'>Upper</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Peito, Costas, Ombros, Braços</td></tr>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Sex</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-filled mud-chip-size-small mud-chip-color-secondary'>Lower</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Quadríceps, Isquiotibiais, Glúteos</td></tr>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Sáb</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-outlined mud-chip-size-small'>Descanso</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Descanso Total</td></tr>
                <tr class='mud-table-row'><td class='mud-table-cell'>Dom</td><td class='mud-table-cell'><span class='mud-chip mud-chip-outlined mud-chip-size-small'>Descanso</span></td><td class='mud-table-cell'>Descanso Total</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>